                "message": "✨ Add ipod-no-autosync to keep iPod plays for Legacy Scrobbler\n\nStops Finder/AMPDevicesAgent (and older iTunes) from syncing the iPod on\nplug-in, with status, undo, a Play Counts backup and an optional launchd\nagent that backs up on every mount. Documented in the listening plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCoTQdiqAtvt2N3KVo",
                "tree": {
